653	     * by Bean Validation on the request DTO, so a value reaching this point is either {@code null}
654	     * (absent) or already valid.
655	     *
656	     * @param email the email address as submitted, or {@code null} when absent
657	     * @return the lower-cased email, or {@code null} when absent
